	"nodes":[
		{"color":"#80b1e5","height":1890,"id":"a91d53f4b9bd9501","label":"基本知识","type":"group","width":1610,"x":200,"y":-720},
		{"color":"6","height":2300,"id":"a40c1c29177754ca","label":"接入AI","type":"group","width":1260,"x":2240,"y":240},
		{"color":"5","height":2280,"id":"638767f82360c764","label":"基础简介","type":"group","width":960,"x":-1280,"y":-700},
		{
			"color":"6",
			"height":740,
			"id":"4cdc8a9801cf9a92",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":null},
			"text":"# AI \n\n## Copliot 插件配置\n\n### 安装 `Copilot` 插件\n访问 [http://10.100.86.71/WindCodeCopilot/authorize/token](http://10.100.86.71/WindCodeCopilot/authorize/token), 万得之家扫码，点击复制按钮获取token\n\n### 填写参数\n- **模型名称** 和 **BaseURL**\n![01-Copilot配置指南](../08-AI集成/01-Copilot配置指南.md)\n- **DisplayName**： 随便取一个\n- **API Key**: 第一步获取的token\n\n> 1. 勾选**CORS**, obsidian 会存在的请求头会导致跨域问题\n> 2. 如果是思维链模型，勾选 `Reasoner`\n> 3. 如果模型能识别图片：勾选 `vision`, 例如使用 `gpt-4` 模型\n> 4. 如果模型支持联网收索: 勾选 `websearch`\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":1120,
			"x":2320,
			"y":300
		},
		{
			"color":"2",
			"height":460,
			"id":"b230f4ef84c7de4e",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"# AI + 知识库\n\n**WFG - FT**\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":877,
			"x":-1240,
			"y":-680
		},
		{
			"color":"3",
			"height":460,
			"id":"61c9cf3dbad373a7",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"# 知识库安装\n\n![01-什么是Obsidian](../01-基础入门/01-什么是Obsidian.md#安装)\n\n## 使用 Git 团队内同步文档\n\n$Obsidian + Git = IDE + Git$\n\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":877,
			"x":-1240,
			"y":120
		},
		{
			"color":"#6ab6f0",
			"height":474,
			"id":"8bc81071f178bb58",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# 连接\n\n![04-双链与标签系统](../01-基础入门/04-双链与标签系统.md#双链)",
			"type":"text",
			"width":745,
			"x":296,
			"y":680
		},
		{
			"color":"#69aee2",
			"height":455,
			"id":"699d2ef2a21fb46f",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# 标签\n\n![04-双链与标签系统](../01-基础入门/04-双链与标签系统.md#标签)\n\n\n>  和标题不同, `# 标题`，标题和 `#` 之间有空格",
			"type":"text",
			"width":745,
			"x":980,
			"y":-40
		},
		{
			"color":"#6ab6f0",
			"height":436,
			"id":"82483b7c0b31821d",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# Frontmatter\n![04-项目管理](../04-项目管理/01-Projects插件使用.md#属性)\n\n>  这里可以定义文档的，作者，标签，日期，等等元数据\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":745,
			"x":540,
			"y":-696
		},
		{
			"color":"2",
			"height":640,
			"id":"e4be0b6079458d29",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# 插件安装\n\n![06-Templater模板系统](../05-效率工具/06-Templater模板系统.md#插件)\n\n\n![04-Git版本控制](../07-团队协作/04-Git版本控制.md)",
			"type":"text",
			"width":920,
			"x":-1283,
			"y":720
		},
		{
			"color":"6",
			"height":500,
			"id":"ffd333649527e3b2",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"# \n## 提问模式\n1. `Chat`, 自由问答\n2. `vault`, 基于知识库问答\n    - 基于标签的索引\n\n## 常用 prompts\n1. 保存在 `copilot-conversations` 目录下\n2. 保存对话为单独笔记 `copilot-conversation`\n\n## 引用文件\n\n1. 和文档引用一样，使用 `[[]]` 符号引用文件",
			"type":"text",
			"width":1120,
			"x":2320,
			"y":1180
		},
		{
			"color":"4",
			"height":820,
			"id":"d9f83fa713be73ea",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"# 完善文档\n\n## 发版记录从邮件📧 --> 文档\n\n![06-Templater模板系统](../05-效率工具/06-Templater模板系统.md#模板)\n\n> 飞书的快捷键也是 `/` 健\n\n- 在**发布记录**目录下，新建文件，引用文档\n- 如实填写，使用链接关联 -->  技术设计文档，需求文档\n- \n\n## 管理文档 \n![01-Projects插件使用](../04-项目管理/01-Projects插件使用.md)\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":1440,
			"x":3840,
			"y":700
		},
		{
			"color":"2",
			"height":580,
			"id":"c98a2a509c6f92fa",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"## Q&A\n\n>  知识库的本质不是存储，而是让集体智慧流动起来",
			"type":"text",
			"width":1300,
			"x":4100,
			"y":1940
		},
		{
			"color":"6",
			"height":580,
			"id":"2a878f642f83c780",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"text":"# Obsidian-MCP\n\n##  在 Cline / Trae / Cursor ... 中，配置MCP\n\n```json\n    \"obsidian\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\n        \"-y\",\n        \"obsidian-mcp\",\n        \"valut 位置\"\n      ],\n\n      \"disabled\": false,\n      \"alwaysAllow\": [\n        \"list-available-vaults\",\n        \"search-vault\",\n        \"read-note\"\n      ]\n    },\n```\n \n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n\nObsidian --读取文档--> Cline\n\nCline --代码整理成笔记--> Obsidian\n\n\n\n```\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":1060,
			"x":2340,
			"y":1940
		}
	]
}
